Object.assign(window.SITE_TRANSLATIONS["fr"], {"I wrote this music when I had a lot of free time. Now I am getting busier, but I will try to find time to write more. The recordings were made on a piano at school, and the piano was out of tune, but they should give a rough idea of how I intended the pieces to be played. The other pieces have not been named yet; I will think about what to name them.":"J’ai composé ces morceaux à une époque où j’avais beaucoup de temps libre. Aujourd’hui, je suis de plus en plus occupé, mais j’essaierai de trouver le temps d’en écrire d’autres. Les enregistrements ont été réalisés sur des pianos à l’école, qui étaient désaccordés, mais ils devraient donner une idée approximative de la façon dont je souhaitais que ces morceaux soient joués. Les autres morceaux n’ont pas encore de titre ; je réfléchirai aux noms à leur donner."});
Object.assign(window.SITE_TRANSLATIONS["ja"], {"I wrote this music when I had a lot of free time. Now I am getting busier, but I will try to find time to write more. The recordings were made on a piano at school, and the piano was out of tune, but they should give a rough idea of how I intended the pieces to be played. The other pieces have not been named yet; I will think about what to name them.":"これらの曲は、自由な時間がたくさんあった頃に書いたものです。今は以前より忙しくなりましたが、これからも時間を見つけて曲を書きたいと思っています。録音は学校にあったピアノで行い、調律が狂っていましたが、どのように演奏したかったか、おおよその雰囲気は伝わると思います。 ほかの曲にはまだ名前がありません。どんな名前をつけるか考えてみます。"});
Object.assign(window.SITE_TRANSLATIONS["zh"], {"I wrote this music when I had a lot of free time. Now I am getting busier, but I will try to find time to write more. The recordings were made on a piano at school, and the piano was out of tune, but they should give a rough idea of how I intended the pieces to be played. The other pieces have not been named yet; I will think about what to name them.":"这些曲子是我有很多空闲时间时写的。现在我越来越忙了，但我会努力抽出时间创作更多作品。这些录音是在学校用钢琴录制的，当时钢琴有些走音，但应该能让大家大致了解我原本希望如何演奏这些曲子。其他曲子还没有名字，我会想想该给它们取什么名字。"});
Object.assign(window.SITE_TRANSLATIONS["zh-Hant"], {"I wrote this music when I had a lot of free time. Now I am getting busier, but I will try to find time to write more. The recordings were made on a piano at school, and the piano was out of tune, but they should give a rough idea of how I intended the pieces to be played. The other pieces have not been named yet; I will think about what to name them.":"這些曲子是我有很多空閒時間時寫的。現在我越來越忙了，但我會努力抽出時間創作更多作品。這些錄音是在學校用鋼琴錄製的，當時鋼琴有些走音，但應該能讓大家大致瞭解我原本希望如何演奏這些曲子。其他曲子還沒有名字，我會想想該給它們取什麼名字。"});

Object.assign(window.SITE_TRANSLATIONS["fr"], {"I wrote these when I had a lot of free time. Now I am getting busier, but I will try to find time to write more. The recordings were made on a piano at school, and the piano was out of tune, but they should give a rough idea of how I intended the pieces to be played.": "J’ai composé ces morceaux à une époque où j’avais beaucoup de temps libre. Aujourd’hui, je suis de plus en plus occupé, mais j’essaierai de trouver le temps d’en écrire d’autres. Les enregistrements ont été réalisés sur des pianos à l’école, qui étaient désaccordés, mais ils devraient donner une idée approximative de la façon dont je souhaitais que ces morceaux soient joués.", "1 · A Gentle Return": "1 · Un doux retour", "Open the piano score for A Gentle Return": "Ouvrir la partition pour piano de « Un doux retour »", "First page of A Gentle Return": "Première page de « Un doux retour »", "Original recording of A Gentle Return": "Enregistrement original de « Un doux retour »", "2 · The Edge of Hope": "2 · Au bord de l’espoir", "Open the piano score for The Edge of Hope": "Ouvrir la partition pour piano de « Au bord de l’espoir »", "First page of The Edge of Hope": "Première page de « Au bord de l’espoir »", "Original recording of The Edge of Hope": "Enregistrement original de « Au bord de l’espoir »", "3 · The Turning Sky": "3 · Le ciel changeant", "Open the piano score for The Turning Sky": "Ouvrir la partition pour piano de « Le ciel changeant »", "First page of The Turning Sky": "Première page de « Le ciel changeant »", "Original recording of The Turning Sky": "Enregistrement original de « Le ciel changeant »"});
Object.assign(window.SITE_TRANSLATIONS["ja"], {"I wrote these when I had a lot of free time. Now I am getting busier, but I will try to find time to write more. The recordings were made on a piano at school, and the piano was out of tune, but they should give a rough idea of how I intended the pieces to be played.": "これらの曲は、自由な時間がたくさんあった頃に書いたものです。今は以前より忙しくなりましたが、これからも時間を見つけて曲を書きたいと思っています。録音は学校にあったピアノで行い、調律が狂っていましたが、どのように演奏したかったか、おおよその雰囲気は伝わると思います。", "1 · A Gentle Return": "1 · 穏やかな帰還", "Open the piano score for A Gentle Return": "「穏やかな帰還」のピアノ譜を開く", "First page of A Gentle Return": "「穏やかな帰還」の楽譜の1ページ目", "Original recording of A Gentle Return": "「穏やかな帰還」のオリジナル録音", "2 · The Edge of Hope": "2 · 希望の淵", "Open the piano score for The Edge of Hope": "「希望の淵」のピアノ譜を開く", "First page of The Edge of Hope": "「希望の淵」の楽譜の1ページ目", "Original recording of The Edge of Hope": "「希望の淵」のオリジナル録音", "3 · The Turning Sky": "3 · 巡る空", "Open the piano score for The Turning Sky": "「巡る空」のピアノ譜を開く", "First page of The Turning Sky": "「巡る空」の楽譜の1ページ目", "Original recording of The Turning Sky": "「巡る空」のオリジナル録音"});
Object.assign(window.SITE_TRANSLATIONS["zh"], {"I wrote these when I had a lot of free time. Now I am getting busier, but I will try to find time to write more. The recordings were made on a piano at school, and the piano was out of tune, but they should give a rough idea of how I intended the pieces to be played.": "这些曲子是我有很多空闲时间时写的。现在我越来越忙了，但我会努力抽出时间创作更多作品。这些录音是在学校用钢琴录制的，当时钢琴有些走音，但应该能让大家大致了解我原本希望如何演奏这些曲子。", "1 · A Gentle Return": "1 · 温柔的归途", "Open the piano score for A Gentle Return": "打开《温柔的归途》的钢琴乐谱", "First page of A Gentle Return": "《温柔的归途》乐谱的第一页", "Original recording of A Gentle Return": "《温柔的归途》的原始录音", "2 · The Edge of Hope": "2 · 希望的边缘", "Open the piano score for The Edge of Hope": "打开《希望的边缘》的钢琴乐谱", "First page of The Edge of Hope": "《希望的边缘》乐谱的第一页", "Original recording of The Edge of Hope": "《希望的边缘》的原始录音", "3 · The Turning Sky": "3 · 变幻的天空", "Open the piano score for The Turning Sky": "打开《变幻的天空》的钢琴乐谱", "First page of The Turning Sky": "《变幻的天空》乐谱的第一页", "Original recording of The Turning Sky": "《变幻的天空》的原始录音"});
